  "question": {
    "text": "Consider the statements <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mn>1</mn></math> and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mn>2</mn></math> :<br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mn>1</mn></math> : Conductivity always increases with decreases in the concentration of electrolyte.<br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mn>2</mn></math> : Molar conductivity always increases with decreases in the concentration of electrolyte.<br />The correct option among the following"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mn>1</mn></math> is wrong and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mn>2</mn></math> is correct",
